--- !u!114 &1541249810
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1541249808}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: aad4ee7684d74934eb77849d4530a3f7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialog
  textComponent: {fileID: 771642819}
  textSpeed: 0.05
  dialogueParts:
  - partName: Part 1
    lines:
    - Welcome to Drug Empire
    - You are destined to be the next Heisenburger and become a drug lord
    - But first you will need ingredients to create drugs.
    - Go ahead and build yourself a greenhouse.
  - partName: Part 2
    lines:
    - Good job.
    - Now tap on the greenhouseand go ahead a plant something
  - partName: Part 3
    lines:
    - Now that you have some ingredients its time to cook!
    - Here are some cash for you to build a factory.
    - Same as the greenhouse just tap on it and select any drugs you want to create.
    - Given that you have enough ingredients.
  - partName: Part 4
    lines:
    - Congrats on making your first buck.
    - You can also upgrade your buildings to unlock more ingredients and drugs.
    - You can also expand your land to place more buildings.
    - Im sure you can figure out the rest as you go.
    - Good luck.
